// Data for the living city (src/life.js): Porto's moving transport.
//
//   node scripts/fetch-life.mjs
//
// Writes data/life.json. The alignments below are the real OSM geometry
// (Overpass, retrieved 2026-10-02, ODbL), decimated and oriented:
//
//   funicular  Funicular dos Guindais (1891, rebuilt 2004): the real
//              railway=funicular alignment, top station (Batalha) first.
//              Guindais is a single track with a mid passing loop, so the
//              two car tracks share both stations and split across the
//              middle. The split is generated by a +-1.4 m lateral offset
//              with a sin() ramp (0 at the stations, max mid-way).
//   trams      the three historic STCP lines - 1 (Infante <-> Passeio
//              Alegre), 18 (Clérigos <-> Passeio Alegre), 22 (Carmo <->
//              Batalha) - from OSM route relations 6077696, 15867094 and
//              2772495, ordered polylines decimated to ~25 m.
//   cablecar   Teleférico de Gaia (2011): the two real stations (OSM
//              aerialway=station) and the gondola line between them.
//   rail       Rolling stock on the Douro crossings: the Metro do Porto
//              (Linha D) across the Luís I upper deck, and CP mainline
//              trains on the Ponte de São João to Campanhã. Real OSM
//              alignments (relation 2567504, Linha do Norte ways): the
//              bridge deck height comes from data/dimensions.json (Luís I
//              upper deck 60 m, São João 66 m above the river).
//   boats      River traffic on the Douro: rabelo boats, cruisers and the
//              Gaia <-> Ribeira ferry. The alignments are authored over the
//              real river channel (checked against the OSM water in
//              scripts/smoke-life.mjs), not derived from a single OSM way.
//   fountains  [] (Braga's list is not generalised: the spray builder then
//              does nothing in Porto, as today).
//
// To refresh, re-derive the arrays from Overpass:
//   way["railway"="funicular"](41.138,-8.615,41.146,-8.604)
//   rel(6077696);out geom;  # 1;  rel(15867094); # 18;  rel(2772495); # 22
//   way["aerialway"~"gondola|station"](41.130,-8.625,41.150,-8.595)
// Node 22, no dependencies.
import { writeFileSync, mkdirSync } from 'node:fs';
